Rule 7 (if the input tensor has fewer than 3 dimensions, it must have at least one dimension.)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) < 3 then ndim(v_1) > 0
>>
Rule 8 (Input tensor must have positive shape dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, if ndim(v_1) > 0 then ndim(v_1) - 1 else 0] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 9 (if the input is a tuple, the dtypes of the tensor within it should match.)
{v_1 : tuple(tensor)} |= if v_1.len > 1 then ∃i ∈ [1, v_1.len - 1] : true
